{"articleNo":"105344","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=105344&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 봄학기 2차 어학 정기강좌 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.04.14","hit":"2863","attachments":[{"name":"유의사항.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105344&attachNo=72150"},{"name":"안진희_feedback[1].pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105344&attachNo=72393"},{"name":"이현정_feedback.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=105344&attachNo=73285"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">안녕하세요?</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">늘 최고의 강사진과 함께 본교생들의 어학 성적 향상을 이루도록 노력하</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">는 국제교류교육원입니다.</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">여러분들의 강좌 선택을 돕고자&nbsp;강사별 피드백을 첨부하오니&nbsp;참고하셔서, </font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">강좌 선택에 활용하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;국제교류교육원 어학 강좌는 연 6회 실시되는 정기강좌와 수시로 진행되</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font color=\"#3db7cc\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">는 어학특강으로 나뉘며, </span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">두 강좌 모두 국제교류교육원 졸업외국어강좌로</span></strong></font></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><font color=\"#3db7cc\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">인정되오니, </span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">이점 착오없으시기 바랍니다!</span></strong></font></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">감사합니다.</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong></strong><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;</font></p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 국제교류교육원장</font></span></strong></p><p><font color=\"#3db7cc\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/6a753ce7-41e6-486c-b3d7-cd19566a4280.JPG\"> <p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
